STR_NEWS_NUCLEAR_DOWN           :{STRING} Nuclear Power Plant output down
STR_NEWS_NUCLEAR_CLOSE          :{STRING} Nuclear Power Plant decommissioned

STR_NEWS_HYDRO_NEW              :New {STRING} constructed near {STRING}!
STR_NEWS_HYDRO_UP               :{STRING} Hydroelectric Dam output increasing
STR_NEWS_HYDRO_DOWN             :{STRING} Hydroelectric Dam output decreasing
STR_NEWS_HYDRO_CLOSE            :{STRING} Hydroelectric Dam decommissioned

STR_NEWS_TIDAL_NEW              :New {STRING} built near {STRING}!
STR_NEWS_TIDAL_UP               :{STRING} Tidal Power Station output up
STR_NEWS_TIDAL_DOWN             :{STRING} Tidal Power Station output down
STR_NEWS_TIDAL_CLOSE            :{STRING} Tidal Power Station closed

STR_NEWS_WIND_NEW               :New {STRING} constructed near {STRING}!
STR_NEWS_WIND_UP                :{STRING} Wind Farm output increasing
STR_NEWS_WIND_DOWN              :{STRING} Wind Farm output decreasing
STR_NEWS_WIND_CLOSE             :{STRING} Wind Farm decommissioned

STR_NEWS_SOLAR_NEW              :New {STRING} established near {STRING}!
STR_NEWS_SOLAR_UP               :{STRING} Solar Farm output increasing
STR_NEWS_SOLAR_DOWN             :{STRING} Solar Farm output decreasing
STR_NEWS_SOLAR_CLOSE            :{STRING} Solar Farm has shut down

